<amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1787930097"/></metadata></head><body dur="4:20.727" ttm:agent="v2"><div begin="17.043" end="37.536" itunes:songPart="Verse" ttm:agent="v1"><p begin="17.043" end="22.138" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="17.043" end="18.113">针变成了</span><span begin="18.113" end="19.129">雨滴</span> <span begin="19.129" end="20.071">能扎进人</span><span begin="20.071" end="20.799">皮</span><span begin="20.799" end="22.138">肤里</span></p><p begin="24.847" end="30.397" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="24.847" end="25.971">都没合衬的</span><span begin="25.971" end="26.974">武器</span> <span begin="26.974" end="27.542">卖伞</span><span begin="27.542" end="28.041">的人</span><span begin="28.041" end="28.556">在</span><span begin="28.761" end="29.476">笑</span><span begin="29.476" end="30.397">你</span></p><p begin="31.517" end="37.536" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="31.517" end="31.976">你说</span><span begin="31.976" end="32.779">不怕</span><span begin="32.779" end="33.658">痛</span> <span begin="34.454" end="34.987">就会</span><span begin="34.987" end="35.403">有</span><span begin="35.403" end="36.720">人模仿</span><span begin="36.720" end="37.536">你</span></p></div><div begin="40.859" end="1:01.667" itunes:songPart="Verse" ttm:agent="v1"><p begin="40.859" end="46.128" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="40.859" end="41.888">也许弱不</span><span begin="41.888" end="42.696">胜衣</span> <span begin="42.696" end="43.318">但爱好</span><span begin="43.318" end="43.939">和平</span><span begin="43.939" end="44.398">与</span><span begin="44.704" end="45.171">真</span><span begin="45.171" end="46.128">理</span></p><p begin="48.655" end="54.424" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="48.655" end="49.727">不入你眼的</span><span begin="49.727" end="50.658">花臂</span> <span begin="50.693" end="51.293">把倒下</span><span begin="51.293" end="51.861">的人</span><span begin="51.861" end="52.442">都</span><span begin="52.661" end="53.159">扶</span><span begin="53.159" end="54.424">起</span></p><p begin="55.822" end="1:01.667" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="55.822" end="56.552">既然</span><span begin="56.552" end="57.587">来了</span> <span begin="58.449" end="58.731">就</span><span begin="58.731" end="59.233">一</span><span begin="59.233" end="59.531">定</span><span begin="59.531" end="1:00.534">输得</span><span begin="1:00.534" end="1:01.667">起</span></p></div><div begin="1:03.505" end="1:19.098" itunes:songPart="Chorus"><p begin="1:03.505" end="1:06.857" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:03.505" end="1:04.124">我想我</span><span begin="1:04.124" end="1:04.692">可以</span><span begin="1:04.692" end="1:05.140">拯</span><span begin="1:05.140" end="1:05.427">救</span><span begin="1:05.427" end="1:05.991">世</span><span begin="1:05.991" end="1:06.857">界</span></p><p begin="1:07.484" end="1:11.221" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:07.484" end="1:07.870">我</span><span begin="1:07.870" end="1:08.635">是来自</span><span begin="1:08.635" end="1:09.619">银河</span><span begin="1:09.619" end="1:09.886">的</span><span begin="1:09.886" end="1:10.403">少</span><span begin="1:10.403" end="1:11.221">年</span></p><p begin="1:11.398" end="1:16.364" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:11.398" end="1:11.837">怎</span><span begin="1:11.837" end="1:12.559">么这儿神</span><span begin="1:12.559" end="1:13.137">佛</span><span begin="1:13.137" end="1:13.404">已</span><span begin="1:13.404" end="1:14.172">满天</span> <span begin="1:14.266" end="1:14.529">却</span><span begin="1:14.529" end="1:15.039">全</span><span begin="1:15.039" end="1:15.296">是</span><span begin="1:15.296" end="1:16.364">一片</span></p><p begin="1:16.626" end="1:19.098" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:16.626" end="1:17.540">无助</span><span begin="1:17.540" end="1:18.257">的笑</span><span begin="1:18.257" end="1:19.098">脸</span></p></div><div begin="1:19.358" end="1:37.829" itunes:songPart="Chorus"><p begin="1:19.358" end="1:22.828" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:19.358" end="1:20.040">要不要</span><span begin="1:20.040" end="1:20.504">一起</span><span begin="1:20.504" end="1:20.976">拯</span><span begin="1:20.976" end="1:21.262">救</span><span begin="1:21.262" end="1:21.824">世</span><span begin="1:21.824" end="1:22.828">界</span></p><p begin="1:23.340" end="1:27.196" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:23.340" end="1:23.790">你</span><span begin="1:23.790" end="1:24.492">也曾是</span><span begin="1:24.492" end="1:25.473">无畏</span><span begin="1:25.473" end="1:26.225">的少</span><span begin="1:26.225" end="1:27.196">年</span></p><p begin="1:27.782" end="1:31.358" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:27.782" end="1:28.467">被规则</span><span begin="1:28.467" end="1:28.743">毁</span><span begin="1:28.743" end="1:31.358">灭</span></p><p begin="1:31.735" end="1:37.829" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:31.735" end="1:32.395">也不曾</span><span begin="1:32.395" end="1:32.747">妥</span><span begin="1:32.747" end="1:33.419">协</span><span begin="1:34.496" end="1:34.958">的</span><span begin="1:35.461" end="1:36.413">信</span><span begin="1:36.413" end="1:37.829">念</span></p></div><div begin="1:52.092" end="2:12.948" itunes:songPart="Verse" ttm:agent="v1"><p begin="1:52.092" end="1:57.536" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:52.092" end="1:52.292">用</span><span begin="1:52.292" end="1:53.272">最渴望的</span><span begin="1:53.272" end="1:54.252">眼睛</span> <span begin="1:54.252" end="1:55.268">看着黑白</span><span begin="1:55.268" end="1:55.822">的</span><span begin="1:56.119" end="1:56.503">电</span><span begin="1:56.503" end="1:57.536">影</span></p><p begin="1:59.970" end="2:05.615" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:59.970" end="2:01.103">就快要举目</span><span begin="2:01.103" end="2:02.119">无亲</span> <span begin="2:02.119" end="2:03.154">但也没有</span><span begin="2:03.154" end="2:03.660">了</span><span begin="2:04.013" end="2:04.581">把</span><span begin="2:04.581" end="2:05.615">柄</span></p><p begin="2:06.959" end="2: